  "content": "<p>这是对TheCyberBrick开发的《蜘蛛2.0》模组的分支与延续。</p>\n<p>感谢GrandeMalum资助1.12.2版本的移植工作。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>Nyf的蜘蛛2.0</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>原版蜘蛛还不够让你毛骨悚然？你希望蜘蛛能<em>真正流畅地攀爬</em>？！<br>\n《蜘蛛2.0》使普通蜘蛛和洞穴蜘蛛能够在墙壁和天花板上行走，同时改进了它们的AI，让它们几乎能绕过任何障碍物找到路径。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Rn2HwLP.gif\" alt=\"\">  </p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fnyfsmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f5d02e4d-0b48-4a61-9ecf-4b563eb97354.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
